        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">See the proposed structure at <a href=\"https://github.com/dipikabh/mdn-css-reorg/blob/main/css-tree-proposed.json\">css-tree-proposed.json</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Steps performed</h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Created the <code class=\"notranslate\">css/reference/at-rules</code> directory and a listing page for \"At-rules\" (<code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/reference/at-rules/index.md</code>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Moved the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">css_syntax/at-rule_functions</code> directory under <code class=\"notranslate\">css/reference/at-rules</code>.</p>\n <details>\n <summary>Breadcrumb screenshot for at-rule functions before the reorg:</summary>\n <kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/509132102-e5b72bc6-24f7-42d5-9eb6-d7db16bdfd3c.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..qea5irLTzpOsWtJPXqOvb2CW85kO-vRdckqvSckx1bw\"><img width=\"460\" height=\"100\" alt=\"breadcrumb for at-rule functions before the reorganization\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/509132102-e5b72bc6-24f7-42d5-9eb6-d7db16bdfd3c.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..qea5irLTzpOsWtJPXqOvb2CW85kO-vRdckqvSckx1bw\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 100px;\"></a></kbd>\n </details>\n <details>\n <summary>Breadcrumb screenshot for at-rule functions after the reorg:</summary>\n <kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/509132106-9bbde155-198a-4b99-ae9e-a4b574038d50.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..aKD7OeZ1TBMo0ula-gmoA0WNB_L9nnXFZmqMnH6ndto\"><img width=\"460\" height=\"100\" alt=\"breadcrumb for at-rule functions after the reorganization\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/509132106-9bbde155-198a-4b99-ae9e-a4b574038d50.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..aKD7OeZ1TBMo0ula-gmoA0WNB_L9nnXFZmqMnH6ndto\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 100px;\"></a></kbd>\n </details>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Moved all pages with <code class=\"notranslate\">page-type: css-at-rule</code> and their child directories (e.g., <code class=\"notranslate\">@page/page-orientation</code>) under <code class=\"notranslate\">css/reference/at-rules</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated paths in the sidebar (<code class=\"notranslate\">files/sidebars/cssref.yaml</code>) for \"At-rules\" and added a link for the new listing page.<br>\nAlso removed the entry <code class=\"notranslate\">Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule_functions</code> (<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule_functions\" rel=\"nofollow\">current link</a>) from the <code class=\"notranslate\">Syntax</code> guide grouping (<a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/f336c5b6795a562c64fe859aa9ee2becf223ad8a/files/sidebars/cssref.yaml#L258\">link to code on GH</a>) to correctly reflect the hierarchy in breadcrumbs (as shown in previous screenshot).</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>After the reorg, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule_functions\" rel=\"nofollow\">At-rule functions</a> will no longer be linked from the sidebar. This needs to be addressed in the future.</li>\n<li>Also note that at-rule descriptors (such as the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@font-palette-values/font-family\" rel=\"nofollow\">font-family</a> descriptor) currently don't appear in the sidebar. Using \"<code class=\"notranslate\">depth: 2</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">tags: css-at-rule-descriptor</code>\" doesn't solve this because descriptors get listed at the same level as their parent at-rules, rather than being nested as child nodes under respective at-rules. A proper hierarchical solution is needed.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<ol start=\"5\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Removed the \"Index\" from the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule\" rel=\"nofollow\">At-rules guide</a>. Updated its slug to make it plural, from <code class=\"notranslate\">Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rules</code>. Added this guide to the sidebar (instead of the At-rule functions).</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">File structure before and after</h3>\n<details>\n<summary>Current structure:</summary>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"files/en-us/web/css/\n.\n.\n├── @function\n├── @import\n    └── layer_function\n.\n├── @property\n│   ├── inherits\n│   ├── initial-value\n│   └── syntax\n├── @scope\n├── @starting-style\n.\n.\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/\n.\n.\n├── @function\n├── @import\n    └── layer_function\n.\n├── @property\n│   ├── inherits\n│   ├── initial-value\n│   └── syntax\n├── @scope\n├── @starting-style\n.\n.\n</code></pre></div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>After the move:</summary>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"files/en-us/web/css/reference/at-rules/\n.\n.\n├── @function\n├── @import\n    └── layer_function\n.\n├── @property\n│   ├── inherits\n│   ├── initial-value\n│   └── syntax\n├── @scope\n├── @starting-style\n.\n.\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/reference/at-rules/\n.\n.\n├── @function\n├── @import\n    └── layer_function\n.\n├── @property\n│   ├── inherits\n│   ├── initial-value\n│   └── syntax\n├── @scope\n├── @starting-style\n.\n.\n</code></pre></div>\n</details>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3562136397\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41720\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41720/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41720\">#41720</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3565794997\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41735\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41735/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41735\">#41735</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3570605768\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41746\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41746/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41746\">#41746</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3582334648\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41792\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41792/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41792\">#41792</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Discussion: <a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/256\">https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/256</a><br>\nTracker issue: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2978311041\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/662\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/662/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/662\">mdn/mdn#662</a></p>",
